00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:48.640
Since I told them to count on me, I can't leave empty handed.

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:50.560
What is this?

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:52.560
Cu-min Se-eds?

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:54.400
Tur-me-ric?

