00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:00.940
What should we do?

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:04.700
I wonder what Chiaki went to buy.

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:09.830
Everything is for the love of Turmeric!

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:13.200
Mexican Mexican Jalapeños!

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:16.620
Don't wanna cry, Cinnamon, Cardamom.

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:19.130
It's no use, Paprika!

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:21.800
Green Green Corianders~

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:24.170
Confusing Saffron.

00:21:24.170 --> 00:21:26.010
A little bit of Chocolate!

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:29.300
The Chocolate is tasty!

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:31.510
But, if there is tomorrow...

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:36.230
I'm back!

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:38.190
Welcome back.

00:21:38.190 --> 00:21:39.520
Sorry, Chiaki.

00:21:39.520 --> 00:21:41.820
That memo was an error.

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:45.530
Everything is for the love of Turmeric!

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:49.070
Mexican Mexican Jalapeños!

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:52.910
Don't wanna cry, Cinnamon, Cardamom.

00:21:52.910 --> 00:21:54.910
It's no use, Paprika!

00:21:54.910 --> 00:21:58.000
Green Green Corianders~

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:02.210
Seconds please!

00:22:02.210 --> 00:22:03.960
There's still more.

00:22:03.960 --> 00:22:06.220
Opinions, opinions please.

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:07.380
It's absolutely great.

00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:10.180
It's better than the regular taste.

00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:13.430
It's probably because you bought those spices.

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:15.730
It was the work of the Curry Fairy.

00:22:15.730 --> 00:22:17.440
The Curry Fairy?

00:22:17.440 --> 00:22:18.770
Yes!

00:22:26.580 --> 00:22:28.860
Hey, Hosaka.

00:22:28.860 --> 00:22:32.120
You made a boxed lunch for Haruka-chan again, right?

00:22:32.120 --> 00:22:33.120
Are you interested?

00:22:33.120 --> 00:22:34.700
Nope.

00:22:37.330 --> 00:22:40.500
Today's lunch is a special curry.

00:22:41.210 --> 00:22:42.460
Want to see?

00:22:43.090 --> 00:22:45.210
Curry boxed lunch?

00:22:45.210 --> 00:22:51.430
If he were to open it here, the pungent smell would spread to the people in the class!

00:22:51.430 --> 00:22:54.100
You must not do that, Hosaka!

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:58.100
Your plus point was that you wouldn't cause trouble unless you were approached.

00:22:58.100 --> 00:23:00.440
W-Wait a minute.

00:23:00.440 --> 00:23:05.320
Hosaka, that's a Pandora's Box. You must not open it.

00:23:05.320 --> 00:23:08.110
It's not a Pandora's Box, it's a boxed lunch.

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:14.990
If you open it, you'll be called the Curry Fairy for the rest of your school life.

00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:18.700
A Fairy? That doesn't sound too bad.

00:23:31.550 --> 00:23:34.100
A curry boxed lunch filled with spices is not bad.

00:23:34.100 --> 00:23:35.550
Hey, Hosaka.

00:23:35.550 --> 00:23:37.010
Help me open the windows.

00:23:37.850 --> 00:23:38.720
Okay.

00:23:39.180 --> 00:23:41.440
Next time on Minami-ke Okaeri:

00:23:41.440 --> 00:23:42.770
Even In A Quarrel.

00:23:42.770 --> 00:23:43.980
Full throttle!
